      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Direction A — “Ledger”. Warm paper, ink type, one serif for the numbers that matter. Colour only ever means a state: yellow = on the call, green = done, red = not reached.\n\nSix sections replace fifteen: Live · Calls · Outbound · Inbound · Flows · Data. Everything on the screens is sample data; phone numbers are masked by design.\n\nOther directions are on the second page."
    },
